---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import UnitCircle from '../components/UnitCircle.astro';
import ToolCards from '../components/ToolCards.astro';
---
<Layout>
<section class="home-stage">
  <div class="home-intro"><div class="eyebrow">A playground for curious minds</div><h1>A little play.<br/>A big <em>aha.</em></h1><p>Move a point. Change an angle. Watch the math fall into place.</p><a class="primary-link" href="/tools/">Find your next experiment <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="home-note"><span class="note-mark" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><span>Start right here.<br/><strong>What happens at 90°?</strong></span></div><span class="free-note">Free to explore · No account needed</span></div>
  <div class="home-experiment"><UnitCircle compact/><a class="experiment-link" href="/unit-circle/">Open the full unit circle <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>
<div class="stat-strip"><span><strong>12</strong>interactive explorers</span><span><strong>8</strong>shapes to discover</span><span><strong>16</strong>ideas explained</span><span><strong>100</strong>ways to practice</span></div>
<div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Follow your curiosity</div><h2>What will click today?</h2><p>Pick something interesting. See where it takes you.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">All tools & collections ↗</a></div><ToolCards/>
<div class="learning-strip"><div><span class="strip-label">SMALL STEPS. REAL UNDERSTANDING.</span><h2>You’ve got this. Try eight questions.</h2><p>No timer, no pressure. Just a little practice and a clearer picture.</p></div><a href="/practice/">Let’s give it a go ↗</a></div>
</Layout>
